Description: Quick Look-style file previews for Dolphin
 Select a file in Dolphin and press Space to preview images, camera RAW
 photos, animations, video, audio, text, PDF and office documents in a
 light floating window. Arrow keys step through the folder and Dolphin's
 selection follows.
 .
 Includes the Dolphin Space hook, the "KDEGlance: Quick Look" context-menu
 action, and an on-demand D-Bus activated viewer service. Office document
 previews use LibreOffice when it is installed.
